        "payload": "tree e206c4edb0dad110ed0126a576222cd4f847fdda\nparent 4d463de80408d7ddcd6049a7d12d000515fa83ee\nauthor ismaelsadeeq <abubakarsadiqismail@proton.me> 1790333406 +0100\ncommitter ismaelsadeeq <abubakarsadiqismail@proton.me> 1790584975 +0100\n\nfees: rename the default fee_rate_estimator value to \"auto\"\n\n\"none\" read as though fee estimation was disabled, when it actually\nselects the default combined behavior: the lower of the block policy\nand mempool fee rate estimates, falling back to the block policy\nestimate when the mempool estimator can't produce one.\n\nRename the public value (and the FeeRateEstimatorType::NONE enumerator)\nto \"auto\", which describes what it does. Unknown values are still\ntreated as to auto, so the previous \"none\" spelling works.\n",
