        "sha": "32737d20c31c33c6cb01738d41c52ffe4524b157",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/32737d20c31c33c6cb01738d41c52ffe4524b157"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 32737d20c31c33c6cb01738d41c52ffe4524b157\nparent 6a07b66e3b2d0ea71c580515110a05fcd959b744\nauthor ismaelsadeeq <abubakarsadiqismail@proton.me> 1790176086 +0100\ncommitter ismaelsadeeq <abubakarsadiqismail@proton.me> 1790587089 +0100\n\nfees: clear mined-block stats when the mempool load fails\n\nWhen the mempool fails to load at startup (persistence disabled, or a\nmissing or corrupt mempool.dat), init notifies the fee_rate_estimator_man,\nwhich clears its tracked mined-block window. Otherwise the estimator\nwould keep a window describing a mempool the node no longer has and,\nonce the mempool refilled, serve an estimate built on it.\n\nClearing makes the estimator report insufficient data until the window refills from the\ncurrent tip, so the combined estimate falls back to the block policy\nestimate meanwhile.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTp92/X8LZmU6fYk5kOOQjzZJiYiAUCarow0gAKCRAOOQjzZJiY\niBI/APsFq3BI9+29P+tAfabJbxyo5tdaeu7Vr6fmN76+vWILSgEAl0UQdPfGky1I\nhdcXc46zyX/HQSWfsnMQsC2n0Pfd9gc=\n=i/Lq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
