      ],
      "message": "fees: clear mined-block stats when the mempool load fails\n\nWhen the mempool fails to load at startup (persistence disabled, or a\nmissing or corrupt mempool.dat), init notifies the fee_rate_estimator_man,\nwhich clears its tracked mined-block window. Otherwise the estimator\nwould keep a window describing a mempool the node no longer has and,\nonce the mempool refilled, serve an estimate built on it.\n\nClearing makes the estimator report insufficient data until the window refills from the\ncurrent tip, so the combined estimate falls back to the block policy\nestimate meanwhile.",
